{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "今天能做什么",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 75.16,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "spoken": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.237
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "写合约的人，检查每个交换函数：最小输出和截止时间，是不是由调用者传进来。",
   "spoken": "写合约的人，检查每个交换函数：最小输出和截止时间，是不是由掉用者传进来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 4.62,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 4.62,
   "speechEnd": 11.598
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "所有签名，用 EIP-712，带上 nonce 和截止时间。",
   "spoken": "所有签名，用 EIP-712，带上 nonce 和截止时间。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 12.04,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 12.04,
   "speechEnd": 16.729
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "审计的人，拿同一份签名提交第二次。第二次也成功，就是漏洞。",
   "spoken": "审计的人，拿同一份签名提交第二次。第二次也成功，就是漏洞。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 17.14,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 17.14,
   "speechEnd": 22.454
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "修复要两个结果：修复前，重放成功；修复后，被拦下。",
   "spoken": "修复要两个结果：修复前，虫放成功；修复后，被拦下。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 22.88,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 22.972,
   "speechEnd": 27.869
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "普通用户，大额兑换设合理的滑点，不用自动的高滑点，可以走私有交易通道。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，大额兑换设合理的滑点，不用自动的高滑点，可以走私有交易通道。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 28.3,
   "dur": 6.88,
   "speechStart": 28.3,
   "speechEnd": 34.999
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "签名前看清链 ID、合约地址、数额和期限。钱包只显示哈希，或者提示盲签，就不签。",
   "spoken": "签名前看清链 ID、合约地址、数额和期限。钱包只显示哈希，或者提示盲签，就不签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 35.4,
   "dur": 8.8,
   "speechStart": 35.494,
   "speechEnd": 43.999
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "回到开头。滑点设 5%，为什么可能真的付 5%？",
   "spoken": "回到开头。滑点设 5%，为什么可能真的付 5%？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 44.42,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 44.42,
   "speechEnd": 49.404
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "因为交易在打包之前是公开的，滑点就是你公开的最差报价。",
   "spoken": "因为交易在打包之前是公开的，滑点就是你公开的最差报价。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 50.12,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 50.12,
   "speechEnd": 55.189
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "这在交易走公开内存池时成立。走私有通道，搜索者在打包前看不到它。",
   "spoken": "这在交易走公开内存池时成立。走私有通道，搜索者在打包前看不到它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 55.62,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 55.62,
   "speechEnd": 61.501
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "顺序可以被买，签名可以被重放。",
   "spoken": "顺序可以被买，签名可以被虫放。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 61.92,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 61.92,
   "speechEnd": 65.805
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "签之前看清内容，发之前想好，谁会先看到它。",
   "spoken": "签之前看清内容，发之前想好，谁会先看到它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-11.wav",
   "start": 66.22,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 66.22,
   "speechEnd": 70.62
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "下一集讲可升级合约与代理。",
   "spoken": "下一集讲可升级合约与代理。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-12.wav",
